  body: "# Capital disregards\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation
    or entitlement decision.\n\nFind opening disregard provisions, legislation citations and the referenced
    DMG memo.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital, PDF page 35](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35).\n\
    \nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos.
    Source SHA-256: `f5c610b29bdb81e11736409b7f33ccf7917a4d8945f2821802801073e0d753ee`.\n"
